// g_BattleLimitLandscaperCenter.posX and g_BattleLimitLandscaperCenterZ from actor X/Z and scans g_BattleLimitLandscaperMeshWorkingBlob.ptr
// eight-byte points, with signed-short count g_BattleLimitLandscaperMeshWorkingBlob divided by eight.
// Chooses the first strictly smallest unsigned comparison of squared X/Z distance and stores its
